+Proposal, review and control are separate responsibilities on the actual host,
+not mandatory separate computers. Use genuine independent review tasks when
+available. A missing reviewer leaves affected acceptance pending and does not
+block unrelated work. A second self-authored success sentence is not verification.
+Give reviewers frozen evidence and acceptance criteria without the author's
+expected verdict. Parallel readers, disjoint writers and reviewers retain their
+actual identities; only the coordinator integrates and publishes. Child completion
+is not a scientific pass or a reason to end the research loop.
