+Restore the authorized execution target and inspect its actual compute, data,
+runtime and budget. The local control agent submits feasible commands on that
+target and collects measured evidence; its own computer is not the default GPU host. Use no Docker
+and assume no GPU or paid model service. Missing capabilities remain explicit.
+The generated_unexecuted label applies only while an artifact is actually
+unexecuted, not permanently to everything produced through a Web interface.
