+Restore existing SSH/runbook choices at startup; reuse already authorized targets.
+Read full-runtime setup only when that particular runtime is selected.
+Do not require Local handoff files for a host-contained project. Do not relabel a
+scientific workload as maintenance to evade evidence requirements.
